{"page":406,"verses":[{"verse_key":"30:16","surah":30,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَمَّا ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَكَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا وَلِقَآئِ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ فِى ٱلْعَذَابِ مُحْضَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"while those who disbelieved and denied Our messages and the meeting of the Hereafter will be brought for punishment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَمَّا","en_gloss":"But as for","transliteration":"wa-ammā","verse_key":"30:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"30:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"30:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَكَذَّبُوا۟","en_gloss":"and denied","transliteration":"wakadhabū","verse_key":"30:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","en_gloss":"Our Signs","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"30:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلِقَآئِ","en_gloss":"and (the) meeting","transliteration":"waliqāi","verse_key":"30:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"30:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"then those","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","verse_key":"30:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"30:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","verse_key":"30:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُحْضَرُونَ","en_gloss":"(will be) brought forth","transliteration":"muḥ'ḍarūna","verse_key":"30:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:16"}]},{"verse_key":"30:17","surah":30,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"فَسُبْحَـٰنَ ٱللَّهِ حِينَ تُمْسُونَ وَحِينَ تُصْبِحُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So celebrate God’s glory in the evening, in the morning-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَسُبْحَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"So glory be to","transliteration":"fasub'ḥāna","verse_key":"30:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"30:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"حِينَ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"ḥīna","verse_key":"30:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تُمْسُونَ","en_gloss":"you reach the evening","transliteration":"tum'sūna","verse_key":"30:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَحِينَ","en_gloss":"and when","transliteration":"waḥīna","verse_key":"30:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تُصْبِحُونَ","en_gloss":"you reach the morning","transliteration":"tuṣ'biḥūna","verse_key":"30:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"١٧","en_gloss":"(17)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:17"}]},{"verse_key":"30:18","surah":30,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَهُ ٱلْحَمْدُ فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَعَشِيًّا وَحِينَ تُظْهِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"praise is due to Him in the heavens and the earth- in the late afternoon, and at midday.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَهُ","en_gloss":"And for Him","transliteration":"walahu","verse_key":"30:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","en_gloss":"(are) all praises","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","verse_key":"30:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"30:18"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"30:18"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"30:18"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَعَشِيًّۭا","en_gloss":"and (at) night","transliteration":"waʿashiyyan","verse_key":"30:18"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَحِينَ","en_gloss":"and when","transliteration":"waḥīna","verse_key":"30:18"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تُظْهِرُونَ","en_gloss":"you are at noon","transliteration":"tuẓ'hirūna","verse_key":"30:18"},{"pos":9,"ar":"١٨","en_gloss":"(18)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:18"}]},{"verse_key":"30:19","surah":30,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"يُخْرِجُ ٱلْحَىَّ مِنَ ٱلْمَيِّتِ وَيُخْرِجُ ٱلْمَيِّتَ مِنَ ٱلْحَىِّ وَيُحْىِ ٱلْأَرْضَ بَعْدَ مَوْتِهَا ۚ وَكَذَٰلِكَ تُخْرَجُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He brings the living out of the dead and the dead out of the living. He gives life to the earth after death, and you will be brought out in the same way.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يُخْرِجُ","en_gloss":"He brings forth","transliteration":"yukh'riju","verse_key":"30:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْحَىَّ","en_gloss":"the living","transliteration":"l-ḥaya","verse_key":"30:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"30:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمَيِّتِ","en_gloss":"the dead","transliteration":"l-mayiti","verse_key":"30:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَيُخْرِجُ","en_gloss":"and He brings forth","transliteration":"wayukh'riju","verse_key":"30:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْمَيِّتَ","en_gloss":"the dead","transliteration":"l-mayita","verse_key":"30:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"30:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْحَىِّ","en_gloss":"the living","transliteration":"l-ḥayi","verse_key":"30:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَيُحْىِ","en_gloss":"and He gives life","transliteration":"wayuḥ'yī","verse_key":"30:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"(to) the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍa","verse_key":"30:19"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَعْدَ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿda","verse_key":"30:19"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَوْتِهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"its death","transliteration":"mawtihā","verse_key":"30:19"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"and thus","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"30:19"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تُخْرَجُونَ","en_gloss":"you will be brought forth","transliteration":"tukh'rajūna","verse_key":"30:19"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٩","en_gloss":"(19)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:19"}]},{"verse_key":"30:20","surah":30,"ayah":20,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنْ ءَايَـٰتِهِۦٓ أَنْ خَلَقَكُم مِّن تُرَابٍ ثُمَّ إِذَآ أَنتُم بَشَرٌ تَنتَشِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"One of His signs is that He created you from dust and- lo and behold!- you became human and scattered far and wide.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنْ","en_gloss":"And among","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"30:20"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"His Signs","transliteration":"āyātihi","verse_key":"30:20"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنْ","en_gloss":"(is) that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"30:20"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَلَقَكُم","en_gloss":"He created you","transliteration":"khalaqakum","verse_key":"30:20"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"30:20"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تُرَابٍۢ","en_gloss":"dust","transliteration":"turābin","verse_key":"30:20"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"30:20"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِذَآ","en_gloss":"behold","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"30:20"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَنتُم","en_gloss":"You","transliteration":"antum","verse_key":"30:20"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بَشَرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) human beings","transliteration":"basharun","verse_key":"30:20"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَنتَشِرُونَ","en_gloss":"dispersing","transliteration":"tantashirūna","verse_key":"30:20"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٢٠","en_gloss":"(20)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:20"}]},{"verse_key":"30:21","surah":30,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنْ ءَايَـٰتِهِۦٓ أَنْ خَلَقَ لَكُم مِّنْ أَنفُسِكُمْ أَزْوَٰجًا لِّتَسْكُنُوٓا۟ إِلَيْهَا وَجَعَلَ بَيْنَكُم مَّوَدَّةً وَرَحْمَةً ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّقَوْمٍ يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Another of His signs is that He created spouses from among yourselves for you to live with in tranquillity: He ordained love and kindness between you. There truly are signs in this for those who reflect.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنْ","en_gloss":"And among","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"30:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"His Signs","transliteration":"āyātihi","verse_key":"30:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنْ","en_gloss":"(is) that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"30:21"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَلَقَ","en_gloss":"He created","transliteration":"khalaqa","verse_key":"30:21"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"30:21"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"30:21"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَنفُسِكُم